    "faq.kicker": "Questions",
    "faq.items": [
      ["How much will it cost?", "The price isn't decided yet. People on the list hear it first, before launch."],
      ["Does it work on Android?", "Not for now: Norður is an iPhone app. If you'd like Android, sign up and pick \"Other\": it counts."],
      ["Do I need internet in Iceland?", "For live data yes, but the app shows the last saved copy when there's no signal, and there's an offline pack to download beforehand."],
      ["Can I try it early?", "There's a beta: people on the list get an invitation when there are places."],
      ["What do you do with my e-mail?", "Only what you chose: Norður updates and the launch notice. No third-party ads, no sharing. All the details are in the privacy notice."],
    ],
    "footer.privacy": "Privacy",
